shadPS4 is a PlayStation 4 emulator written in C++.

With the QT option the official Qt launcher (shadPS4QtLauncher) is built
as well. It manages the game library, per-game settings, controller
mappings, patches and cheats, and starts games with the shadps4 binary
from this package.

With the PKGEXTRACTOR option the standalone PS4 .pkg extractor from
shadPS4Plus is installed as well:
  shadps4-pkg-extractor <file.pkg> [output dir]
  shadps4-install-pkg <file.pkg>        (extracts a game, update or DLC
                                         into $SHADPS4_GAMES_DIR or
                                         $SHADPS4_ADDONS_DIR)
  shadps4-batch-install-pkg <directory> (installs every .pkg in it)
